OL,3,APoland detains man suspected of
OL,4,Aplanning assassination of PM Tusk
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolish Prime Minister Donald Tusk said
OL,7,Fa man accused of plotting an
OL,8,Fassassination attack against him and
OL,9,Fhis defence minister has been detained.
OL,11,FThe interior ministry earlier reported
OL,12,Fthat police had received credible
OL,13,Finformation about possible attacks
OL,14,Fagainst Tusk and Wladyslaw
OL,15,FKosiniak-Kamysz.
OL,17,FSecurity services convened a special
OL,18,Fmeeting on Sunday after receiving
OL,19,Finformation about the planned attacks,
OL,20,Fwith a spokesman saying officials were
OL,21,Ftreating the threat as "deadly
OL,22,Fserious".
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
